<title>USA: GOLF-LEADERBOARD AT U.S. OPEN CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADERBOARD AT U.S. OPEN CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Maryland 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaderboard during</p>
<p>the second round of the U.S. Open golf championship at</p>
<p>Congressional Country Club on Friday (players U.S. unless noted,</p>
<p>a=amateur):</p>
<p> Colin Montgomerie (Britain)     5 under (yet to tee off)</p>
<p> Hal Sutton			    4 under</p>
<p> Steve Stricker			4 under</p>
<p> Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe)	   3 under</p>
<p> Hideki Kase (Japan)		 2 under</p>
<p> Tom Lehman			    2 under (through 5 holes)</p>
<p> Dave Schreyer			 1 under (through 1)</p>
<p> Jeff Sluman			   1 under</p>
<p> Justin Leonard			1 under</p>
<p> Paul Azinger			  even par (through 4)</p>
<p> Ernie Els (South Africa)	  even (through 3)</p>
<p>Other notables:</p>
<p> Jose Maria Olazabal (Spain)     1 over (through 4)</p>
<p> Tiger Woods			   1 over par (through 5)</p>
<p> Steve Jones			   2 over (through 5)</p>
<p> Nick Faldo (Britain)		3 over (through 4)</p>
<p> John Daly			     8 over (through 3)</p>
<p>Tee times for leading players:</p>
<p>Montgomerie 12:20 pm (1620 gmt)</p>
<p> Stricker     9:10</p>
<p> Sutton	 1:50 pm</p>
<p> McNulty	2:10</p>
<p> Kase	   3:00</p>
